$$\begin{align*}
\tan 47^\circ &= \frac{30}{d} \\
d &= \frac{30}{\tan 47^\circ} \\
&\approx 27.98\text{ m}
\end{align*}$$
The car is $27.98\text{ m}$ from the base of the cliff.

